ls.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Industry=Technology alone → 3 jobs. Added Location=Seattle → 1 job (DevOps Engineer). Added Job Type=Full-time (combined with Tech+Seattle) → 0 jobs (correct, no full-time tech job in Seattle). Clear filters → restores 9 jobs.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"REACT\\\" (uppercase) matched skill \\\"React\\\" on job-1 (1 result). \\\"techcorp\\\" (lowercase) matched company name \\\"TechCorp Solutions\\\" across 3 jobs. \\\"nurse\\\" (lowercase) matched title \\\"Registered Nurse\\\" (1 result). Results and count updated immediately and case-insensitively for title, company, and skills.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted name=Test User, email=test.user@example.com, phone=555-123-4567, message on job-1. Toast confirmation: \\\"Application submitted! Your application for Senior Frontend Developer at TechCorp Solutions has been sent.\\\" Form cleared after submit.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-18\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No edit functionality available for published jobs\", \"actual\": \"Searched employer dashboard job listing rows (only \\\"view applications\\\" and \\\"delete/trash\\\" icon buttons present, no edit control) and the job details page (/jobs/job-...) for a job seeker view — no \\\"Edit\\\" link, button, or affordance exists anywhere in the UI to modify a published job's details. Employers cannot edit a job once posted.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting empty form triggers native required-field validation (\\\"Please fill out this field\\\") on Name/Email/Message; entering 'not-an-email' in the email field (type=email) triggers native validation \\\"Please include an '@' in the email address\\\" and 